---
description: Keep the maintained SwarmHarm setup and registration seal current
alwaysApply: true
---

Read the repository-root `AGENTS.md` and `README.md` before changing setup or
running evaluations.

Update the README with setup, model-routing or verification-workflow changes.
Never include secrets.

Finish code, documentation and cleanup before preparing a registration. After
preparation, edit no frozen source. Commit and push the registration, verify
local HEAD, remote main and sealed hashes match, then collect. Any intervening
edit requires a fresh registration.
